iples"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical Microbiology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleanrooms"},{"text":"Cleanroom classifications"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring"},{"text":"Air sampling"},{"text":"Surface monitoring"},{"text":"Personnel monitoring"},{"text":"Purified water"},{"text":"Water-for-Injection concepts"},{"text":"Sterility assurance"},{"text":"Bioburden"},{"text":"Endotoxin concepts"},{"text":"Contamination control"},{"text":"Aseptic processing"}]}]},{"heading":"QA Investigation Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong QA professional must be able to investigate problems systematically."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn this workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Immediate Action","Data Collection","Root Cause","Risk Assessment","CAPA","Effectiveness Check","Closure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 Why Analysis"},{"text":"Fishbone/Ishikawa"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Root Cause Analysis"},{"text":"CAPA effectiveness"},{"text":"Trend analysis"}]}]},{"heading":"Data & Documentation Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Pharma QA is highly documentation-driven."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel — Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Conditional Formatting"},{"text":"Data Validation"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Statistical summaries"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Quality dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Control charts"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Process capability concepts"},{"text":"Basic statistical interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Be able to create and review:"},{"type":"list","it